---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Steve Weiler"
  description="Systems engineer and software developer specializing in infrastructure, desktop software, automation, and AI-enabled systems."
>
  <main class="site-main">
    <section class="hero hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Windows •  Linux • Infrastructure • AI • Software</p>
        <h1>Systems Engineer • Software Developer • AI Engineer</h1>
        <p>
          I combine 25+ years of enterprise IT experience with infrastructure,
          desktop, and software development in Rust, C#, Go, Python, Windows,
          Linux, and AI-assisted systems.
          </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="/projects/">View Projects</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/resume/Steve-Weiler-Resume.pdf">Download Resume</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-panel card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Focus areas</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Desktop software and compositor work</li>
          <li>Systems automation and infrastructure tooling</li>
          <li>AI-enabled workflows and practical integrations</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mini-grid">
          <div class="mini-stat">
            <span>25+</span>
            <p>years in enterprise IT</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-stat">
            <span>4</span>
            <p>primary languages shipped</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-stat">
            <span>3</span>
            <p>core disciplines blended together</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p>
      <h2>What I build</h2>
    </section>

    <section class="cards">
      <article class="card project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <div class="project-badge">FD</div>
          <div>
            <h3><a class="project-title-link" href="/focaldesk/">FocalDesk</a></h3>
            <p class="project-kicker">Wayland desktop environment</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="project-visual project-visual--focaldesk project-visual-link" href="/focaldesk/" aria-label="Read the FocalDesk case study">
          <img
            class="project-visual-image project-visual-image--contain"
            src="/images/focaldesk-screenshot.png"
            alt="FocalDesk desktop environment screenshot"
          >
        </a>
        <p>Rust Wayland desktop environment with compositor, native apps, encrypted credential storage, capture, and AI integration.</p>
        <a class="project-text-link" href="/focaldesk/">Read case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="card project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <div class="project-badge">FA</div>
          <div>
            <h3><a class="project-title-link" href="/focal-agent/">Focal Agent</a></h3>
            <p class="project-kicker">Local-first Windows AI assistant</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="project-visual project-visual--focal-agent project-visual-link" href="/focal-agent/" aria-label="Read the Focal Agent case study">
          <div class="visual-assistant">
            <div class="visual-assistant-shell">
              <div class="visual-assistant-top">
                <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-red"></span>
                <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-yellow"></span>
                <span class="visual-terminal-dot dot-green"></span>
                <span class="visual-assistant-title">focal-agent</span>
                <span class="visual-terminal-badge">Ready</span>
              </div>
              <div class="visual-assistant-body">
                <div class="visual-assistant-chips">
                  <span>Voice</span>
                  <span>Plugins</span>
                  <span>System</span>
                </div>
                <div class="visual-assistant-thread">
                  <div class="assistant-message assistant-message--user">What is running on this PC?</div>
                  <div class="assistant-message assistant-message--agent">The Inventory plugin needs permission to inspect processes.</div>
                  <div class="assistant-message assistant-message--result">Permission required · Review request</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
        <p>Windows desktop assistant with local Ollama chat, offline Vosk voice input, and permission-gated external plugins.</p>
        <a class="project-text-link" href="/focal-agent/">Read case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="card project-card">
        <div class="project-header">
          <div class="project-badge">IA</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Infrastructure Automation</h3>
            <p class="project-kicker">Operations tooling</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-visual project-visual--infra">
          <img
            class="project-visual-image"
            src="/images/infrastructure-admin-graphic.png"
            alt="Infrastructure administration dashboard visualization"
          >
        </div>
        <p>Monitoring, VMware migration, OpenNMS dashboards, document automation, and internal business tools.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-strip card">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Open for work</p>
        <h2>Need practical software or infrastructure help?</h2>
        <p>
          I take on projects where operations, automation, and product thinking need to work together.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="button" href="/contact/">Start a conversation</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
